flowchart TD
    A[Boot STM32] --> B[Initialize Clock + GPIO + UART]
    B --> C[Start FreeRTOS Scheduler]
    C --> D[Telemetry Task Runs]
    D --> E[Generate Random / Dummy Telemetry]
    E --> F[Format Telemetry String]
    F --> G[Send over UART]
    G --> H[Serial Terminal Displays Data]
    H --> D
